      "comment": "CASH THE LOT (1) resumed in a Grade 5 at Healesville and finished sixth over 300m (16.83). Has a good record at this journey. Should be very hard to beat this time. DONKEY FLY (6) unwanted in betting but showed good early dash and led until late, finishing second and beaten a neck (24.30) at Sale in a Free For All over 435m. Has a strong record from box 6, including two wins. Bold showing expected. THAT'S MY BOY (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (23.09) last time in a Grade 5 at Warragul. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. OLD HABITS (3) is always hard to beat when he races at this trip.",
